<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "An ExternalIdentifier is a reference to a resource outside the scope of SPDX 3 content\nthat provides a unique key within an established domain that can uniquely identify an Element."@en .
