<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Security/SsvcDecisionType/trackStar> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "(\"Track\\*\" in the SSVC spec) The vulnerability contains specific characteristics that may require closer monitoring for changes. CISA recommends remediating Track\\* vulnerabilities within standard update timelines."@en .
