<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/AI/useSensitivePersonalInformation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Notes if sensitive personal information is used in the training or inference of\nthe AI models.\n\nThis can include biometric data, addresses or other data that can be used to\ninfer a person's identity.\n\nRelated: hasSensitivePersonalInformation in /Dataset/DatasetPackage"@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ContactPointRelationshipType/compliance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A contact point for compliance (i.e. export control, licensing)."@en .
